src(5,'From Swayamsevak to the man behind the rise of BJP','Express Web Desk, Indian Express','https://indianexpress.com/article/who-is/l-k-advani-profile-bharat-ratna-9142199/','2024-07-04','Journalism','Early Life; Life in Politics, lines 67–84','Migrated from Sindh during Partition in 1947; assisted Jana Sangh MPs from 1957; joined Organiser in 1960, left in 1967. BJP endorsed the temple demand at Palampur in June 1989. Rath Yatra began at Somnath on 25 September 1990, amid Mandal politics; riots accompanied the mobilisation; arrest in Bihar led to BJP withdrawing support from V. P. Singh.','Retrospective article, first published 3 February 2024. Its loose account of 1990–92 and hawala wording are not adopted; legal claims use separate records. Arrest day reported differently elsewhere, so month-level precision is used.')
