src(9,'General elections 1999: Assembly-segment detail','Election Commission of India; CEO Kerala mirror','https://www.ceo.kerala.gov.in/pdf/LOKSABHA-HISTORY/1999-LS.pdf','1999','Official record','PDF pp.317–318; Gandhinagar seven segments and postal ballots','Advani segment votes 165186,80167,68900,26785,22589,41272,48228 plus 102 postal =453229. Seshan 77652,33674,18984,20986,20547,41045,51312 plus85=264285. Constituency valid total741260.','Sum includes postal votes once. This resolves a 70-vote error in a commonly reproduced summary (453299/189014); correct margin188944. Canonical MP-hosted summary failed DNS; independent official segment return supports the adopted totals.',origin='ECI-LS1999')
