src(26,'Advani’s Nation First blog: reproduced text','L. K. Advani; Scroll reproduction','https://scroll.in/latest/918970/full-text-lk-advani-says-bjp-has-never-regarded-those-who-disagree-with-it-as-anti-national','2019-04-04','Primary statement','Reproduced post lines128–146; nomination context112','Advani advocated diversity, expression, internal democracy and treating political opponents as adversaries. Described cultural nationalism and good governance as party ideals; credited Upadhyaya and Vajpayee. BJP nominated Amit Shah from Gandhinagar for2019.','His claim about BJP’s entire historical conduct is an attributed self-description. Article’s narrative says six consecutive wins; actual post says six wins since1991, with1996 absence.',origin='ADVANI-BLOG-2019-04-04')
